# Independent V3 critique and response

Fresh quiet_visual_review inspected the reference, full desktop/mobile pressure frames and desktop crop. High-confidence findings: flat white decal fill, regular scalloped outline, thin contour rings instead of architectural depth, faint outer rings; interface obscures point on both devices and mobile overlays conceal much of the effect. Medium: scale does not imply the reference vastness. Separate scene limitation: sparse grey terrain lacks brass/teal enclosure.

V4 response: soften the core transition, add irregular multiscale grain and edge variation, break uniform contour phase. This is a focused absence effect; it does not reconstruct surrounding Ark architecture. Placement V3 improves desktop separation but mobile remains unresolved. No acceptance claimed. V3 build passed; final-source verification remains required after V4.
